  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of a pilot project on energy efficiency (decision 95/87)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project builds on data collection and analysis of national energy use, regulations, and industry performance to establish benchmarks and efficiency targets for heat exchangers. Using inputs from manufacturers and regulators, it will develop an action plan, consolidated in a project document for submission.</narrative>
